{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月19日 08:48 星期四</p>\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">最後更新   2026年11月19日 09:09 星期四</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛，港島線整體行車時間一度延5至8分鐘。至8時42分，港鐵指信號設備故障已修復，港島線列車服務陸續恢復正常。</p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:43:54.025198+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T00:48:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T09:48:59.116716+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T01:37:28.528170+00:00","content_hash":"e9ead75114ed95bf27dd3388838cc7528587807fb0eeda104e6af02274ebb417","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}